e_id":"U_kgDOBcty7w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97219311?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongDo-Hyun","html_url":"https://github.com/YongDo-Hyun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongDo-Hyun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongDo-Hyun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongDo-Hyun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongDo-Hyun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongDo-Hyun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongDo-Hyun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongDo-Hyun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongDo-Hyun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YongDo-Hyun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-18T19:48:25Z","updated_at":"2026-01-18T19:48:25Z","body":"> Do you have an example of projects that use this license?\n\n\nYes, the Project Tick General Public License is currently in use.\nProject Tick uses a monorepo structure. The following subproject within\nthe monorepo is licensed under the Project Tick General Public License\n(PT-GPL-1.0): <https://github.com/Project-Tick/ProjT-Launcher/tree/main/website-root>\nThe applicable license text for this subproject is available at: <https://github.com/Project-Tick/ProjT-Launcher/blob/main/website-root/LICENSE>\nThis subproject is used to build and publish the official Project Tick\nwebsite, which is available at: <https://projecttick.org/>","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3765672005/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3773537738","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2928#issuecomment-3773537738","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2928","id":3773537738,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE87g653K","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-20T15:41:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T15:41:16Z","body":"This appears to be your own license for use with your own personal projects.\n\nProject Tick appears to be a fork of https://github.com/PrismLauncher/PrismLauncher where you have [replaced their AGPL-3.0 license with your newly drafted license](https://github.com/Project-Tick/ProjT-Launcher/commit/f4cdbe301bfb7d556e16fbc3e3346126f8bb5a05). The large number of people who show up as \"Contributors\" in GitHub for this repo appear to be persons who actually contributed to Prism; virtually all issues / PRs in your repo appear to be from you.\n\nAs with several other recent submissions (see e.g. #2921, #2919, #2913), this appears to be a license used solely for your own personal projects, and does not have actual, substantial use. See \"Other factor\" 3 in the [License Inclusion Principles](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/license-inclusion-principles.md). I see no evidence of its use by anyone else.\n\nThe SPDX License List is not a registry for newly-drafted licenses with no actual, substantial use in the wild. Given that, I am closing this issue. Feel free to re-submit in the future if at some point it does have very substantial and significant uptake.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3773537738/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]